+--[ Release Details ]-------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                            |
| Title......: melcom's FFmpeg Audio Normalizer                              |
| Version....: v4.1.2 [Herbstklang Edition]                                  |
| Date.......: October 22, 2026                                              |
| OS.........: Windows (x64)                                                 |
| Type.......: Audio Normalizer & Batch Processor                            |
| Author.....: Andreas 'melcom' Urban                                        |
|                                                                            |
+--[ Fixes & Changes ]-------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                            |
| - Optional encoded-output verification and comparison results              |
| - Corrected two-pass measurements with mastering presets                   |
| - Safe cancellation, output paths, and unmeasurable input handling         |
| - For a complete list of changes see the included CHANGELOG.md.            |
|                                                                            |
+--[ Features & Highlights ]-------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                            |
| - Linear 2-Pass (Preserves Dynamics) & Dynamic 1-Pass Normalization        |
| - Dynamic Live-Sync Inspector with EBU R128 Statistics & True Peak         |
| - Lossless Metadata Editor & Artwork Manager (Zero Re-Encoding)            |
| - Modder-Friendly JSON Theming Engine with Smart Luminance Detection       |
| - FFmpeg Diagnostic Engine (Proactive MAX_PATH & Permission Checks)        |
| - Integrated Player: Graphic Equalizer, Click-to-Seek & Zero-CPU Pause     |
| - Native Drag & Drop Support for Files, Folders & Nested Directories       |
| - High-Precision Export Control: Custom Sample Rates, Bit Depths & VBR     |
| - Optional Queue Columns (Duration, Format, SR) with Async Scanner         |
| - Multi-Format Export Support: WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, OGG                    |
| - Mastering Presets:                                                       |
|   * Transparent: Pure EBU R128 loudness normalization                      |
|   * Cohesive...: Gentle compression & soft clipping for glued audio        |
|   * Punchy.....: Increased impact, transients and presence                 |
|   * Aggressive.: Maximum compression & peak saturation                     |
|                                                                            |
+--[ Notes ]-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                            |
| Built with passion for trackers, musicians, podcasters, streamers,         |
| demosceners and anyone who wants clean, normalized audio without           |
| any command-line headaches.                                                |
